@startuml
autonumber
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "Duty Chief\n" as Chief
participant "Escala App" as System
actor "Firefighter\n" as Firefighter

== 1. Slot Creation & Gap Identification ==
Chief -> System: 1. Publishes roster schedule (Piquete)
System -> System: 2. Detects open slots (Gaps)
Chief -> System: 3. Opens cover request for open slot

== 2. Application & Eligibility Evaluation ==
Firefighter -> System: 4. Views open slots on mobile
Firefighter -> System: 5. Applies for open slot
System -> System: 6. Evaluates eligibility rules\n(Driving licence, certifications & availability)

== 3. Shift Confirmation ==
Chief -> System: 7. Views eligible candidates and selects one
System -> System: 8. Confirms assignment and updates roster schedule
System -> Firefighter: 9. Sends confirmation notification to Firefighter

@enduml